Migrations

One file per schema change, numbered in order (0001_..., 0002_...). Never edit a migration that
has been applied anywhere; add a new one instead:

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
    # rename the file to NNNN_description.py, review it, then:
    uv run alembic upgrade head

Every new table must enable row-level security in the same migration
(ALTER TABLE ... ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY); tests/test_migrations.py enforces it.
